 "names_note": "PROVISIONAL names, manufactured from what each sequence measurably IS and meant to be replaced by ear. Each is <class>_<tempo>_<length>_<voices>_<range>: the tempo band from the first set-tempo meta event, the length band in beats from the longest track over the division, the voice count from distinct program-change values, and the pitch range from the lowest and highest note played. Ties inside one bucket take a Greek-letter suffix in id order. None of this claims a title or a scene -- no name here was taken from outside the ROM, which the evidence boundary forbids, so nothing is asserted that the sequence bytes do not say. Renaming is a one-line edit per entry: build-assets reads this map and falls back to <class>_<id> when an id is absent."
